From 00797fbdb3e57bc68469ec196ee54bdd45e3d638 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timfox <timfox@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:16:45 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lost Coast: Combine squads come out of their templates at
 their triggers

monster_lc_soldier stands hidden at his point_template spot until the
trigger_once or trigger_look that ForceSpawns his squad fires (lc_spawn,
lc_squad from the bake); then he is drawn, solid and at idle. The cue
trigger test is shared with the fisherman's shouts (LC_CueWatch,
LC_ParseCue). -lcsquadtest brings every squad out 3 s after spawn.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
